WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.625
- I did it. I finally did it.

00:00:01.625 --> 00:00:03.875
Andrew Reid won a Super Bowl!!!

00:00:03.875 --> 00:00:05.375
- What a fun, easy sport.

00:00:05.375 --> 00:00:08.041
- I'm telling you all, this has happened before. Look.

00:00:08.041 --> 00:00:08.500
- [Phone speaker:] Andrew Reid won a Super—

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:10.541
- OK, time for that darkness retreat.

00:00:10.541 --> 00:00:13.250
- We are stuck in a script of a show that just keeps repeating itself.

00:00:13.250 --> 00:00:14.625
And its name is—

00:00:17.541 --> 00:00:18.750
I wish I could see things clearly.

00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:20.750
- Try this. It's a little untraditional.

00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:21.375
- Say no more.

00:00:21.875 --> 00:00:25.125
Well, guess I'll go die on the Jets with my Wrangler jeans.

00:00:25.125 --> 00:00:27.125
Woah, some drink.

00:00:27.125 --> 00:00:29.291
- What's he smokin', huh?

00:00:29.291 --> 00:00:30.166
[Laugh track playing]

00:00:30.166 --> 00:00:32.500
- Expired Gatorade from when I was in St. Louis.

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:33.666
[Laugh track playing]
- Back to work!

00:00:33.666 --> 00:00:35.791
JK, maybe this year I'll go back to work.

00:00:35.791 --> 00:00:37.041
[Awww]
- LOL!

00:00:37.041 --> 00:00:38.750
- Is it always like this?

00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:41.375
- B.O.B., will you be my O.C.?

00:00:41.375 --> 00:00:42.125
- Woah.

00:00:42.125 --> 00:00:44.041
- Can't wait to definitely play football this year.

00:00:44.041 --> 00:00:46.666
- Stefon Diggs is disgruntled.

00:00:46.666 --> 00:00:49.541
- Finally, one of my conspiracy theories is true.

00:00:49.541 --> 00:00:51.416
- Welcome, remember to dress up as your—

00:00:51.416 --> 00:00:54.125
- They're reusing scripts! We already did a whole Brady thing.

00:00:54.125 --> 00:00:55.041
- [Together:] Oh, yeah.

00:00:55.041 --> 00:00:56.125
- We're not trapped!

00:00:56.125 --> 00:00:57.625
Next year will be the Bills' year.

00:00:57.750 --> 00:00:58.916
- Next year will be the Bills' year.

00:00:59.416 --> 00:01:00.583
- Next year will be the Bills' year.

00:01:00.708 --> 00:01:01.875
Next year will be the Bills' year.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:03.166
Next year will be the Bills' year.

00:01:03.291 --> 00:01:04.458
Next year will be the Bills' year.

00:01:04.583 --> 00:01:06.291
- Oh, my gosh, he's right.

00:01:06.291 --> 00:01:07.666
Wait, where's Aaron?

00:01:07.666 --> 00:01:09.791
- People will come looking for me if I miss McAfee!

00:01:09.791 --> 00:01:11.041
Woah, a secret door.

00:01:11.041 --> 00:01:13.458
- Aaron, I'm so sorry I left you.

00:01:13.458 --> 00:01:15.666
- I know now...it wasn't your fault.

00:01:15.666 --> 00:01:17.166
[Paper printing]

00:01:17.166 --> 00:01:18.416
- It's next year's scripts.

00:01:18.416 --> 00:01:19.916
Saquon joins the Chiefs?

00:01:19.916 --> 00:01:21.291
OK, don't hate that one.

00:01:21.291 --> 00:01:23.416
- Hello, I am the Script Writer.

00:01:23.416 --> 00:01:26.208
I decide which storylines are epic enough to happen.

00:01:26.208 --> 00:01:28.333
- But free will! Why are you repeating everything?

00:01:28.333 --> 00:01:30.916
- OMG, spectacular catch, Davante.

00:01:30.916 --> 00:01:33.916
The thing is, people only want the same six scripts.

00:01:33.916 --> 00:01:35.791
Chiefs good. Refs bad.

00:01:35.791 --> 00:01:37.416
Chargers lost in a weird way.

00:01:37.416 --> 00:01:38.583
- [Together:] But we wanna win.

00:01:38.583 --> 00:01:40.208
- Then press the fire emoji.

00:01:40.208 --> 00:01:42.791
Destroy the next 100 years of football scripts.

00:01:42.791 --> 00:01:46.708
Choose chaos. That is, if you think that's what people really want.

00:01:46.708 --> 00:01:48.208
- F--k you, script writers.

00:01:48.208 --> 00:01:50.083
- Timeout! I like the routine.

00:01:50.083 --> 00:01:52.166
I underperform one year. I overperform the next.

00:01:52.166 --> 00:01:53.208
I get paid. Repeat.

00:01:53.208 --> 00:01:55.208
- But, Kirk, don't you wanna win?

00:01:55.208 --> 00:01:56.791
- I'm not sure I can.

00:01:56.791 --> 00:01:58.666
- Do you know why I'm so confident?

00:01:58.666 --> 00:02:00.291
- The cigar?
- Cuz you're really good at football?

00:02:00.291 --> 00:02:00.791
- Cuz you're super hot?

00:02:00.791 --> 00:02:02.583
- Because when the abyss stares at me,

00:02:02.583 --> 00:02:04.458
I stare it the f--k back.

00:02:04.458 --> 00:02:06.166
- Kirk, I believe a lot of wacky things.

00:02:06.166 --> 00:02:10.791
But I have to believe any of us, even you, could win.

00:02:11.166 --> 00:02:11.583
[Beeping]

00:02:11.583 --> 00:02:14.958
[Alarm sounding]
- Deleting scripts for Seasons 8-100.

00:02:14.958 --> 00:02:16.250
- [Josh Allen:] Wheeee!

00:02:23.125 --> 00:02:25.958
- Alright, time to approve next year's scripts.

00:02:27.125 --> 00:02:28.541
What? Where are the scripts?

00:02:28.541 --> 00:02:30.458
Davante and Aaron need to get back together,

00:02:30.458 --> 00:02:32.666
Clammy was supposed to come back in a big way.

00:02:32.666 --> 00:02:35.291
We were finally gonna do an Avengers Endgame parody.

00:02:35.291 --> 00:02:37.916
Every episode was gonna go so viral!

00:02:37.916 --> 00:02:40.166
No! The unknown!

00:02:40.166 --> 00:02:43.916
Anything can happen! Oh, god, what if the Lions are good?

